  <jpcrp_cor:NameOfGroupCompanyHoldingLargestAmountOfInvestmentSharesInGroup contextRef="CurrentYearInstant">株式会社三井住友銀行</jpcrp_cor:NameOfGroupCompanyHoldingLargestAmountOfInvestmentSharesInGroup>
