  <jpcrp_cor:PurposeOfShareholdingOverviewOfBusinessAllianceQuantitativeEffectsOfShareholdingAndReasonForIncreaseInNumberOfSharesDetailsOfSpecifiedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentLargestHoldingCompany contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row2Member">同社はクレジット、プライベートエクイティ、不動産などのオルタナティブ資産に強みを持つ、米国を本拠とする資産運用会社であります。</jpcrp_cor:PurposeOfShareholdingOverviewOfBusinessAllianceQuantitativeEffectsOfShareholdingAndReasonForIncreaseInNumberOfSharesDetailsOfSpecifiedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentLargestHoldingCompany>
